Primarily examine news headlines about technological innovation, infrastructure spending, and mergers & acquisitions. Place heavy emphasis on the potential for new technologies (AI, renewable energy, etc.) to drive long-term economic expansion, irrespective of current economic conditions. Give slightly lower weight to news that's considered "old" in the sense of time. Base your sentiment score predominantly on the presence of keywords like "innovation," "investment," and "breakthrough." Conviction increases proportionally to the number of distinct sectors showing activity in these three areas.